Package: PokemonDamage
Title: Simplified Gen 1 Pokemon Damage Calculator
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joshua", "Hansen", , "JSHansen@USF.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A simplified damage calculator based on Generation 1 Pokemon mechanics.
    This package pulls stat information from the 'pokemon' package and uses a
    simplified version of the original damage formula. It excludes type effectiveness
    and STAB, and includes speed-based critical hit chance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
